<title>USA: Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude for end-April.</title>
<headline>Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude for end-April.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's state-owned oil company Empresa Nacional del Petroleo (ENAP) is seeking to buy 960,000 barrels of crude oil for delivery April 24-28, trade sources said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender will be awarded March 6.</p>
<p>In its last purchase tender, ENAP bought some 960,000 barrels of Nigerian Qua Iboe crude for delivery April 8-12.</p>
<p>--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
